  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small ball is attached to a string and moves in a circle with angular speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>. The angle between the string and the vertical is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the radius of the ball’s path?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{\\omega^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g \\sin \\theta}{\\omega^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g \\cos \\theta}{\\omega^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g \\tan \\theta}{\\omega^{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
